  <div class="build_by-golfers">
    <div class="golfers_inner">
      <div class="golfers_heading">
        <h2>
          BUILT BY GOLFERS WHO <br />
          REFUSED TO SETTLE
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="golfers_paragraph">
        <p class="font-subtitle">
          Blue Tees started with a simple question: Why does great golf tech
          cost so much and still look like it was built in 1990s?
        </p>
        <p class="font-subtitle">
          We saw an industry stuck in the past—overpriced tech, outdated
          designs, and a lack of innovation. So we set out to change that. We
          created products that looked better, worked smarter, and didn’t break
          the bank. Our first rangefinder took off, and we haven’t stopped
          innovating since.
        </p>
        <p class="font-subtitle">
          Today, we’re building something bigger: a connected ecosystem of golf
          technology designed to help players own their game. From tee to green,
          our end-to-end platform gives golfers smarter insights, seamless
          experiences, and the confidence to play their best on and off the
          course.
        </p>
        <p class="font-subtitle">
          We’re not here to follow tradition. We’re here to lead the future of
          golf game improvement for every golfer who wants to play their way and
          have a damn good time doing it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
